cruals":78.3,"_gate_rev_volatility":0.13065620897520483,"_gp_rev_volatility":false,"_score_rev_volatility":77.0,"_gate_margin_vs_hist":-0.003765951688277064,"_gp_margin_vs_hist":true,"_score_margin_vs_hist":100.0,"_gate_piotroski":7,"_gp_piotroski":true,"_score_piotroski":77.8,"_gate_spread":-0.011541676327486788,"_gp_spread":false,"_score_spread":0.0,"_gate_roic_consistency":0.5945041773524301,"_gp_roic_consistency":false,"_score_roic_consistency":0.9,"_gate_incr_roic":-1.0,"_gp_incr_roic":false,"_score_incr_roic":0.0,"_gate_margin_advantage":-0.026279046497080072,"_gp_margin_advantage":false,"_score_margin_advantage":24.6,"_gate_pool_share":-0.13938052071466034,"_gp_pool_share":false,"_score_pool_share":0.0,"_gate_rev_durability":null,"_gp_rev_durability":null,"_score_rev_durability":0.0,"_gate_fcf_durability":-0.0883217537309775,"_gp_fcf_durability":false,"_score_fcf_durability":0.0,"_gate_margins":-0.0055069081942019284,"_gp_margins":false,"_score_margins":44.5,"_gate_fund_growth":0,"_gp_fund_growth":false,"_score_fund_growth":0.0,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":0.03667917866809393,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":true,"_score_shrhldr_yield":51.9,"_gate_share_shrink":-0.006096232981187666,"_gp_share_shrink":true,"_score_share_shrink":57.6,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.0093603744149766,"_gp_sbc_dilution":true,"_score_sbc_dilution":84.4,"_gate_insider_own":0.01986,"_gp_insider_own":false,"_score_insider_own":13.2,"_gate_insider_buying":null,"_gp_insider_buying":null,"_score_insider_buying":null,"pf":[],"description_full":"Luxfer Holdings PLC, together with its subsidiaries, develops and manufactures high-performance materials, components, and high-pressure gas containment devices. The company operates through two segments: Gas Cylinders and Elektron. The Gas Cylinders segment manufactures and markets specialized highly engineered containment solutions using aluminum alloys and carbon composite technologies. It offers carbon composite high-pressure, aerospace and aviation, space-related, aluminum and composite medical gas, and specialty aluminum cylinders used for emergency response, healthcare, alternative fuel transportation, aerospace comprising commercial aviation, defense, and space markets. The Elektron segment focuses on specialty materials based primarily on magnesium and zirconium. This segment offers advanced lightweight magnesium alloys; magnesium powders for use in countermeasure flares, defense applications, infrared decoys, and heater meals; and zirconium-based chemicals and oxides used as catalysts converters, industrial catalysis, advanced ceramics, specialty glass, fuel cell components, pharmaceuticals, and other performance-critical applications. The company operates in the United States, the United Kingdom, Japan, Canada, Germany, rest of Europe, the Asia Pacific, and the rest of the world. Luxfer Holdings PLC was founded in 1898 and is based in Riverside, California.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Andrew William John Butcher | CEO & Executive Director | Age 57 | Compensation: $1.5M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 1K people. Revenue per employee of $285K ranks in the below the sector median among Industrials peers. Each employee generates $19K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $3K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 5\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (2/10).","financial_summary":["Luxfer Holdings PLC is a small-cap industrials business with a $463M market cap on $385M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at -3% over the past three years, and a shrinking top line is the hardest headwind any business can overcome.","Returns on capital run at 8% against a 9% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests, and 24% gross margins are typical of commodity economics where competitors can replicate the product cheaply.","The business throws off $26M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 7 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 4.42\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, leverage is comfortably conservative at 0.9\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and interest coverage runs at 7.7\u00d7.","Shareholder yield of 3.7% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Payout ratio looks stretched \u2014 the dividend\u2019s own margin of safety is thin","sev":"red","cat":"dividend"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Revenue growth lags most Industrials peers \u2014 losing share inside the profit pool","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Industrials sector lagging the market significantly, underperforming by 8% over 3 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Industrials ETF trading well below its long-term trend","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Cyclical sectors like Industrials tend to underperform in slowdowns","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Tariff and trade-policy exposure \u2014 industrial exporters sit squarely in the crosshairs of protectionist policy, and retaliatory tariffs can close markets without warning.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Piotroski score 7/9 \u2014 financials improving across profitability, leverage and efficiency","13 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Luxfer (NYSE:LXFR) Stock Price Crosses Above 50 Day Moving Average on Analyst Downgrade","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/05/luxfer-nyselxfr-stock-price-crosses-above-50-day-moving-average-on-analyst-downgrade.html","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793888572.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.772,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["analyst_action"]},{"title":"(LXFR) Risk Channels and Responsive Allocation","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/23/LXFR_Risk_Channels_and_Responsive_Allocation_110226101202_1793632322.html","date":"2026-11-02","timestamp":1793632322.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.202,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Kone Oyj (OTCMKTS:KNYJY) and Luxfer (NYSE:LXFR) Head to Head Survey","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/10/31/kone-oyj-otcmktsknyjy-and-luxfer-nyselxfr-head-to-head-survey.html","date":"2026-10-31","timestamp":1793448165.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.924,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Luxfer (LXFR) Stock Shrugs Off Q3 Earnings Profit Squeeze","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/luxfer-lxfr-stock-shrugs-off-170852370.html","date":"2026-10-30","timestamp":1793380132.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.881,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Luxfer (LXFR) Stock Price Ignores Q3 Earnings Margin Squeeze","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/capital-goods/nyse-lxfr/luxfer-holdings/news/luxfer-lxfr-stock-price-ignores-q3-earnings-margin-squeeze","date":"2026-10-29","timestamp":1793312585.117,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.638,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Luxfer (NYSE:LXFR) Issues Quarterly Earnings Results","source":"thelincolnia